{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Outwit. Outshoot. Outlive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>Quill &gt; Pistol</u></i></strong> is a turn-based dueling game where <strong>logic is your weapon</strong> \u2014 and the only thing standing between you and death.<br>Play as <strong>The Mathematician</strong>, a scholar dragged from the quiet halls of academia into a brutal underground pistol dueling tournament, where cold reasoning meets hot lead\u2026 and one mistake means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each duel is a puzzle.<br>Each opponent, a nightmare.<br>Face twisted inventors, occult marksmen, and brilliant killers as you unravel the secrets behind the tournament\u2019s blood-stained origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will your mind save you?<br>Or will you become another name in the ledger of the dead?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Solve unique logic-based mini-games</strong> to prepare your shot<br>\ud83c\udccf <strong>Earn skill cards</strong> to manipulate the odds<br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Face a gallery of deadly opponents</strong>, each with unique tactics and mind games<br>\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Uncover a stylish, cerebral narrative</strong> filled with wit, duels, and dread<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Engage in turn-based combat</strong> where every decision is a matter of life and death</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717190?t=1747659022","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717190/e6e317432de32605a78f3f6ca21d7ea0b8f4b3e8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747659022","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717190/85ae2e2011c810fe7231e66e66a18d9948d56756/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747659022","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717190/85ae2e2011c810fe7231e66e66a18d9948d56756